"董仲舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6m0_g4r_x9t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m021-0140","start":140,"end":143,"surface":"公羊氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-121-rulin","book_id":"b-shiji-121","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji121-rulin"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:p024","text":"仲舒弟子遂者：蘭陵褚大，廣川殷忠，溫呂步舒。褚大至梁相。步舒至長史，持節使決淮南獄，於諸侯擅專斷，不報，以春秋之義正之，天子皆以為是。弟子通者，至於命大夫；為郎、謁者、掌故者以百數。而董仲舒子及孫皆以學至大官。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"仲舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6m0_g4r_x9t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"褚大","kind":"person","person_id":"tgy_zyu_6ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"殷忠","kind":"person","person_id":"kpg_v1c_i19","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"呂步舒","kind":"person","person_id":"r6k_uj1_o5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"褚大","kind":"person","person_id":"tgy_zyu_6ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"步舒","kind":"person","person_id":"r6k_uj1_o5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"o7s_89o_zka","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin:m024-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"弟子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-121-rulin